meta {
  name: Get Asset Subpath - Categories
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{pim_base_url_v3}}/assets/6aa021b72b6fd055ffb7ca9f/categories
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
  Accept: application/json
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.data: isArray
  res.body.data[0].name: eq WC Test Asset Category
}

docs {
  Confirmed live 2026-09-08. Fully expanded category object, confirming
  "Update Asset.bru"'s `PATCH`-applied `category_ids` linkage actually
  persisted (not just reflected in that one response).

  Subpath discovery (`GET .../bogus_xyz`) raw field list:
  `['id','account_id','assigned','content_type','checksum','extension',
  'file_size','file_type','file_modified','filename','path',
  'downloaded_from','n_catalogs','n_products','public','alt_text',
  'status','created','modified']` -- matches Phase 0's earlier spot-check
  on a different (pre-existing) asset.
}
